# Changes from source

The original code was copied from https://github.com/kelindar/search/tree/main/llama-go.cpp
but has some changes to get it to work with the current version of llama.cpp

- CMakeLists needed `${llama.cpp_SOURCE_DIR}/common` on line 6, there is no
  include subdirectory anymore.
- `llama-go.cpp` had all the `llama_` prefixed functions replaced with `common_`.
